---
import TextPage from '../components/TextPage.astro';
import { SITE } from '../lib/site';
export const prerender = true;
---

<TextPage
  title="Terms of Service"
  eyebrow="Legal"
  description={`The terms for using ${SITE.name} and its free crochet patterns.`}
>
  <p><strong>Last updated:</strong> September 28, 2026</p>
  <p>
    Welcome to {SITE.name}! These terms apply when you use loopedbyhand.com (the “site”). By using the site, you agree
    to them. If you don’t agree, please don’t use the site.
  </p>

  <h2>1. Using the site</h2>
  <p>
    The site and its patterns are free for personal, non-commercial use. You agree not to misuse the site. For example,
    you may not try to break into it, overload it, scrape it in bulk, send spam through its forms or use it for anything
    unlawful.
  </p>

  <h2>2. Our patterns and content</h2>
  <p>
    All patterns, text, photos, illustrations and the site design belong to {SITE.name} and are protected by copyright,
    unless stated otherwise.
  </p>
  <h3>You may:</h3>
  <ul>
    <li>make any item from our patterns for yourself, as a gift or for charity;</li>
    <li>
      sell finished items you’ve made by hand from our patterns in small quantities (a credit such as “Pattern by
      {SITE.name}” with a link is always appreciated);
    </li>
    <li>print a pattern or save it for your own personal use;</li>
