  </p>

  <h2>8. Changes to the site and these terms</h2>
  <p>
    We may change, pause or remove any part of the site at any time. We may also update these terms, and when we do,
    we’ll change the “Last updated” date above. If you keep using the site after a change, you accept the new terms.
